hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
2796,"Hammād ibn Ghaylān ne hamari taraf se riwāyat ki, unhone Abū Dāwūd se riwāyat ki, unhone Shuʿbah se riwāyat ki, unhone Abū Isḥāq se riwāyat ki, aur unhone al-Barāʾ (رضي الله عنه) se riwāyat ki — halānke unhon ne ise un se sīdhe tarīqe se nahīṅ sunā thā — ke Rasūlullāh ﷺ ek Anṣārī jamāʿat ke pās se guzare, jo rāhte meṅ baiṭhe hue the, aur farmāyā:\n\n\Agar tumhēṅ yih karnā hī hai", to salām kā javāb do, mazlūm kī madad karo," aur rāh dikhāo.\""\n\nIs bāb meṅ Abū Hurayrah (رضي الله عنه) aur Abū Shurayḥ al-Khuzāʿī (رضي الله عنه) se bhi riwāyāt hain.\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (رحمه"""
2797,"Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Raan (thigh) awrah hai.\"""""
2798,"Abu Az-Zinad ne riwayat farmayi: \Ibn Jarhad ne mujhe apni taraf se apne baap se ittela di.\"""""
2799,"Salih bin Abi Hassan ne riwayat ki: \Main ne Sa'eed bin Musayyab ko yeh kehte hue suna: 'Beshak Allah Tayyib hain aur woh Tayyib ko pasand karte hain.'\"""""
2800,"# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Ibn Masʿūd (RaziAllahu ʿAnhu) ne Rasool ﷺ se riwayat ki, ﷺ ne farmaya:**\n\n**\Tahiyyat (salam) ki kamalat mein haath lena (musafaha karna) bhi shamil hai.\""**\n\n---\n\n**Is bab mein al-Barāʾ aur Ibn ʿUmar (RaziAllahu ʿAnhumā) ki riwayatein bhi hain.**\n\n**Abū ʿĪsā (Imam al-Tirmidhī) ne farmaya:** Yeh hadith *gharīb* (nādir) hai", aur hum ise sirf Yaḥyā ibn Sulaym ke zariye Sufyān se jaante hain.\n\n**Unhon ne farmaya:** Main ne Muḥammad ibn Ismāʿīl (Imam al-Bukhārī) se is hadith ke bare mein pucha," unhone ise *maḥfūẓ* (mehfooz riwayat) nahi samjha. Unhon ne kaha: \""Mere khayal mein", asal maqsad Sufyān ki Manṣūr se, Manṣūr ki Khaythamah se," aur Khaythamah ki us shakhs se riwayat thi jis ne Ibn Masʿūd (RaziAllahu ʿAnhu) se suna tha ke Rasool ﷺ ne farmaya tha: **'Raat ki guftagu (samar) sirf us shakhs ke liye jaa'iz hai jo namaz parh raha ho ya musafir ho.'**\""\n\n**Muḥammad (Imam al-Bukhārī) ne farmaha:** Balki yeh Manṣūr se", Manṣūr se Abū Isḥāq se, aur Abū Isḥāq se ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ibn Yazīd ya kisi aur se marwi hai," jis ne kaha: **\""Tahiyyat ki kamalat mein haath lena shamil hai.\""**\n\n---\n\n*Yeh riwayat Imam al-Tirmidhī ke nazdeek *gharīb* hai", aur Imam al-Bukhārī ne iski sanad mein shak-o-shubha zahir kiya hai," jis se pata chalta hai ke is isnād mein kisi tarah ki ghalat-fehmi ya ikhtilat ho sakta hai.*"""
2801,"Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman laye...\"""""
2802,"Abu 'Udhrah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki hai, aur woh Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke zinda hone ke waqt mein the; unhon ne Hazrat Aisha Siddiqah (رضي الله عنها) se yeh hadith bayan ki."
2803,Abu Al-Malih Al-Hudhali (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hain ke Hims ke kuch khawateen...
2804,Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki: \Maine Abu Talhah (رضي الله عنه) se suna," woh keh rahe the: 'Maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko farmaate hue suna: \""Farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hotay jahan kutta ho ya tasweer (makhlooqaat ki tasweer) ho.\""'\"""""
2805,Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talhah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rafi' bin Ishaq (raziyallahu anhu) ne unhe ittila farmai.
2806,"Abdullah bin Amr (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki:\n\nEk aadmi do surkh libas pehne hue guzra. Usne Nabi ﷺ ko salaam kiya, lekin Aap ﷺ ne salaam ka jawab nahi diya."
2807,Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne sonay ki angoothhi (gold ring) se mana farmaya.
2808,"Al-Bara bin 'Azib (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat kiya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne humein cheez aagahein aur humein cheez manaa farmaiya. Unhon ne humein mayyit ke janaze ke peeche chalne ka hukm diya.\"""""
2809,Samurah bin Jundab (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Safed libas pehno, kyunke woh tumhare liye sab se zyada paak aur achhe lagte hain," aur apne murdon ko bhi safed kafan mein lifafo do.\"""""
2810,Jabir bin Samurah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: myn nay nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) kw ayk saf sthry rat myn dykha۔
2811,"Abu Rimthah (رضي الله عنه) ne rivaayat ki:\n\n\Main ne Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ko do hari Burud (چادریں) pehne huay dekhi.\"""""
2812,"Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) rwayt krty hyn: \rswl allh (ﷺ) sbh kay wqt ayk syay balwn ky bny hwyy myrt phn kr nklay۔\"""""
2813,Abdullah bin Hassan (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat hain ke unki daadiyan Safiyyah bint Ulaibah aur Dhuhaibah bint Ulaibah (رضي الله
2814,Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay mrdwn kw zafran astamal krnay nay mna frmaya۔
2815,"Ya'la bin Murrah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hykh nby krym (ﷺ) nay ayk shkhs kw khryd frwkht ky halt myn paya awr frmaya: \jao awr asay dhw lw\"""""
2816,"Hadees ka tarjuma ilmi aur adabi Roman Urdu mein:\n\nAsma ki aazad ghulam se naqal kiya: Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se, unhone farmaya: \Maine Umar (رضي الله عنه) ko suna ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: 'Jis shakhs ne duniya mein resham (silk) pehna"," usse aakhirat mein woh kabhi nahi pehne ga.'\"""""
2817,"Al-Miswar bin Makhramah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay:\n\n\rswl allh (ﷺ) nay kchchh chwghay tqsym kyay، lykn anhwn nay mkhrmh (rz all anh) kw kchh nhyn dya۔ mkhrmh (rz all anh) nay kha: aay myray bytay! chlw، hm rswl allh (ﷺ) kay pas chlyn۔ chnanchh myn an kay sath gya۔ anhwn nay kha: andr jao awr an kay lyay nby (ﷺ) kw bla kr lao۔ chnanchh myn nay nby (ﷺ) kw an kay lyay blaya۔\"""""
2818,"Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne Ikrimah ibn Ammar se usi tarah ki riwayat bayan ki jo Ibn al-Mubarak ki riwayat jaisi hai, aur teesri martaba unhone us se kaha: \Tum bimari mein mubtala ho (mazkum).\"" Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se yeh riwayat bayan ki"," unhone kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se yeh riwayat sunayi."""
2819,Ibn Buraidah ne apni se riwayat ki ke unke baap se ke An-Najashi ne Nabi ﷺ ko do kaale aur sadhaara Khuff bheje. To unhon ne unhein pehne.
2820,"Yeh hadith humein Muhammad ibn Wazir al-Wasiti ne riwayat ki, unho ne kaha ke humein Yahya ibn Sa'id ne riwayat ki, unho ne Muhammad ibn 'Ajlan se riwayat ki, unho ne Sumayy se riwayat ki, unho ne Abu Salih se riwayat ki, unho ne Abu Hurayrah (radi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke jab Nabi ﷺ chhinkte to apna chehra apne haath ya apni poshak se dhak lete, is tarah us se apni awaaz dabate. Abu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Yeh ek hasan sahih hadith hai."
2821,Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jis se mashwara maanga jaye," woh amanatdar hai.\"""""
2822,"Umm Salamah (rz all anha) say rwayt hay: rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \js ky mshwray tlb kya jayay wh amant dar hay۔\"""""
2823,"# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Riwayat hai 'Adiyy ibn Thābit (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُ) se, unke wālid se, unke dādā se, jo ise *marfū'* (marfū') riwāyat mein bayān farmāyā, ke Āp (Hazrat Muhammad ﷺ) ne farmāyā:**\n\n> **\Nimāz mein chheenk", ānsū, aur qayūmat, aur haiz, qay, aur naak se khoon behnā," sab Shayṭān ki taraf se hote hain.\""**\n\n**Abū 'Īsā (Imām Tirmidhī رَحِمَهُ اللَّهُ) ne farmāyā:** \""Yeh ek *gharīb* (gharīb) hadith hai. Hum ise sirf Sharīk ki riwāyat se", jo Abū al-Yaqẓān se naql karte hain," jānte hain.\""\n\n**Unhone aur farmāyā:** \""Main ne Muḥammad ibn Ismā'īl (Imām Bukhārī رَحِمَهُ اللَّهُ) se 'Adiyy ibn Thābit", unke wālid," unke dādā ke bāre mein pūchhā. Maine un se pūchhā: 'Adiyy ke dādā kā nām kyā hai?' Unhone farmāyā: 'Mujhe nahīn mālūm.'\""\n\n**Yaḥyya ibn Ma'īn (رَحِمَهُ اللَّهُ) ki taraf se bayān hai ke unhone farmāyā:** \""Unkā nām Dīnār hai.\""\n\n---\n\n### Tarjume ke Notes:\n\n- **رَفَعَهُ (*rafa'ahu*)**: Yeh ishāra hai ke sanad *marfū'* hai", yānī yeh bayān sīdhe Nabī Akram ﷺ ki taraf mansūb hai.\n- **غَرِيبٌ (*gharīb*)**: Aisi hadith jis ki riwāyat sirf ek silsile se, isnād ke ek yā zyāda nuqṭoṅ par, naql kī ga'ī ho.\n- **الشَّيْطَانِ (al-Shayṭān)**: Shayṭān," mal'ūn iblīs.\n- **الصَّلَاةِ (al-ṣalāh)**: Farz aur nāfil namāz.\n- **الْحَيْضُ (al-ḥayḍ)**: Haiz (māhāvarī).\n- **"""
2824,"**Urdu Translation:**\n\nAbdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se teen (log) hon...\"""""
2825,"Isma'il bin Abi Khalid ne riwayat ki hai ke Abu Juhaifah (radiyAllahu anhu) ne farmaya:\n\n\Main ne RasoolAllah (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha – woh safed aur baalon mein safaidi aane lage hue the. Hasan bin Ali (radiyAllahu anhuma) un se sab se zyada mushabihat rakhte hain. Unhon ne hamare liye terh (13) jawaan ontiyan (oontniyan) ka waada kiya tha.\"""""
2826,"Isma'il bin Abi Khalid ne riwayat ki ke Abu Juhaifah (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \Main ne Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ko dekha...\"""""
2827,"Hazrat Ali (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat farmayi: \Maine Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ko Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Razi Allahu Anhu) ke siwa kisi aur ke liye apne donon walidain ka zikr is tarah suna ke woh farmate hain: 'Meri maa aur meri baap tumpar qurban ho.'\"""""
2828,"Hazrat Ali (raz.) rivayat karte hain ke: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne siwaaye Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (raz.) ke aisi jaga apne dono waldain ka zikr nahi farmaya. Jange Uhud ke din farmaya ke: 'Tir chalao!'\"""""
2829,"Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn: \kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay ahd kay dn myray dwnwn waldyn ka zkr frmaya۔\"""""
2830,"Hazrat Anas (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) nay an say frmaya: \aay myray chhwtay bytay!\"""""
2831,"Al-Hasan ibn Ali al-Hulwani al-Khallal aur doosron ne riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, Ma'mar ne hamain khabar di, unho ne al-Zuhri se riwayat ki, unho ne Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab se riwayat ki, unho ne Abu Hurairah (Allah us se razi ho) se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Paanch cheezein fitrat (fitrah) se hain: shaving the pubic hair", circumcision, trimming the moustache, plucking the armpit hair," aur clipping the nails.\"" Abu Isa ne kaha: Ye ek hasan sahih hadith hai."""
2832,"Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ke nazdeek sab se zyada pasand naam 'Abdullah aur 'Abdur-Rahman hain.\"""""
2833,"Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ke nazdeek sab se zyada mukarrar (mahboob) naam 'Abdullah aur 'Abdur-Rahman hain.\"""""
2834,"Hazrat Umar (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n**\Main naam rakhna 'Rafi' se mana karta hoon.\""**"""
2835,"Samurah bin Jundab (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \apnay lrkay ka nam rabh nh rkhw۔\"""""
2836,"Al-A'raj ne riwayat ki ke Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne unhen pighlaaya ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din Allah Ta'ala ke nazdeek sab se zaleel (Akhna) naam us mard ka hai jiska naam 'Malikul-Amlak' (Rajaon ka Raja) hai.\"""""
2837,"Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne \Asiyah\"" ka naam badal diya."""
2838,Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allahu Anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallem) na-pasandeedah (buray) asma (naamon) ko badal detay thay.
2839,"Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mut'im ne apni taraf se riwayat ki ke unke walid ne bayan farmaya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mere chand naam hain: Main Muhammad hoon.\"""""
2840,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne is baat se mana farmaya ke koi shakhs apna naam aur apni kunyah dono ka istemal kare, yani khud ko Muhammad Abul-Qasim naam rakhe."
2841,"Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum apne aap ko mera naam rakho\"""""
2842,"Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke unhone kaha: \Aey Allah ke Rasool (ﷺ)! Agar aap ke baad mere ek beta paida ho to kya main usay aapki Kunyah se naam doon?\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Haan.\"" Toh unhone kaha: \""Yeh mujhe ijazat di gayi.\"""""
2843,"**Urdu Translation (Roman Script):**\n\nAbdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak kuch shiir (kalaam) hikmat (danishmandi) hota hai.\"""""
2844,"Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak kuch shi'r (kalaam) hikmat hai.\"""""
2845,"Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) ne riwayat kiya ke: \Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Masjid mein ek Minbar rakha taake Hassan (Razi Allahu Anhu) us par khade hokar Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki tareef (shairi mein) karein\"" – ya unhon ne yeh kaha: \""Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki hifaazat karein. Aur Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne Hassan (Razi Allahu Anhu) ki Rooh-ul-Qudus (Jibrael Alaihis Salaam) ke saath madad ki hai jab woh Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Waslam) ki tareef karte hain – ya – Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki hifaazat karte hain.\"""""
2846,"Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنهم) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) Umratul-Qada ke dauran Makkah mein dakhil hue aur Hazrat Abdullah bin Rawahah (رضي الله عنهم) unke aage aage chal rahe the aur shairi ke ash'aar padh rahe the:\n\n\Ae kuffaron ke qabeelon! Unke raaste se hat jao — aaj hum uski wahi ke mutaliq tum par hamla karenge; aisa hamla jo sarron ko kandhon se alag kar dega — aur dost ko uske dost ki parwah na hone degi.\""\n\nHazrat Umar (رضي الله"""
2847,**Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu):**\n\nAbū Masʿūd (raz̤allāhu ʿanhu) se riwāyat hai ke Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmayā: \n\Kisī ādmī ko usī ke dāire ikhtiyār (domain) mein namāz imāmat nahīn kī jā saktī," aur na usī ke ghar mein uske muqarrar jagah (place of honor) par kisī ko baiṭhāyā jā saktā hālāṅke uskī ijāzat ke.\""\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (raḥimahullāh) ne farmāyā: Ye ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ hadīs hai."""
2848,Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Arab ke sab se behtar kalām," Labid (رضي الله عنه) ka yeh bayān hai: \n'Allah ke siwa har cheez fānī hai.'\"""""
2849,"Jabir bin Samurah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay:\n\n\myn nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) kay pas sw say zyadh mrtbh bytha۔ aap kay shabh kram (rzwan allh alyhm ajmayn) shaary prhtay awr jahlyt kay zmanay kay waqaat byan krtay thay۔\"""""
2850,"Muhammad bin Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (rz all anh) nay apnay wald (sad bn aby wqas rz all anh) say rwayt ky kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya:\n\n\tm myn say ksy kay lyay yh bhtr hay kh wh apnay pyt kw pyp say bhr day، as kay bjayay kh wh asay shaary say bhr day۔\"""""
2851,Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Tum mein se kisi ke liye yeh behtar hai ke wo apne pet ko pus se bhar de," issey ke wo use shayari se bhar de.\"""""
2852,"Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ki Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan Allah Ta'ala zyadah lalaason ko nafrat karta hai.\"""""
2853,"Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne is baat se mana farmaya ke koi aadmi kisi chat (chhat) par is tarah soaye ke uske aas-paas koi deewaar ya rokna ho, taake woh latak kar na gir jaye."
2854,"Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) humein khayal rakhte the aur dinon mein wa’aaz faramate the, is darr se ke hum bore na ho jayein."
2855,"Abu Salih ne riwayat kiya: \Aine 'Aishah (radiyallahu 'anha) aur Umm Salamah (radiyallahu 'anha) ne puchha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ko amal pasand the jo sab se zyada woh karte the. Unhon ne kaha: \""Jis amal ki woh nawazil kar sakte the"," baghair iske woh is par pabandhi se rahte the.\"""""
2856,"Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \brtnwn kw dhanp lw۔\"""""
2857,"Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) khtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jb tm khwsh zmyn say gzrw\"""""
2858,"Hazrat An-Nawwas bin Sam'an Al-Kilabi (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne seedhi ka ek misaal bayaan ki hai: Raaste ke dono taraf deewarein hain jin par darwaaze khule hue hain.\"""""
